        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668090/extras/199aff2fb997161d494a79da21102aeb.avif?t=1765917436\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sniffin for Bones is a cozy platform game about finding little hidden bones to munch on and solving relaxing puzzles. Relax with a game that doesn't expect you to have quick reactions, complex maneuvers or be a puzzle specialist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex maneuvers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable with few buttons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapted to be played with a controller</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessible</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging but not too difficult puzzles, the game is designed to be played by everyone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple game mechanics, taught in an easy way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing sound effects and ambience</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspiring environments</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has several different environments to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful effects without being too distracting</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3668090/extras/199aff2fb997161d494a79da21102aeb.avif?t=1765917436\" width=800 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sniffin for Bones is a cozy platform game about finding little hidden bones to munch on and solving relaxing puzzles. Relax with a game that doesn't expect you to have quick reactions, complex maneuvers or be a puzzle specialist.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Simple controls</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No complex maneuvers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable with few buttons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapted to be played with a controller</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessible</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging but not too difficult puzzles, the game is designed to be played by everyone</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple game mechanics, taught in an easy way</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing sound effects and ambience</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Inspiring environments</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has several different environments to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful effects without being too distracting</p></li></ul>",
